</svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="investors_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="investors_tab-pane-content"><h2 class="heading-style-h3 text-color-green">Financial Information</h2><div class="faq-paragraph w-richtext"><p>The Company’s financial statements are set out in the Admission Document.</p><p>‍</p><p>The Annual Report and accounts of the Company will be made up to 31 March each year with copies expected to be sent to Shareholders within the following six months.</p><p>‍</p><p>The Company will also publish unaudited half-yearly reports to 30 September each year with copies expected to be posted to Shareholders within the following three months. </p></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--accordion--variant="investor-accordion" class="expandable-single"><div class="expandable-top"><div class="heading-style-h5 heading-alternative w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12">Annual Report &amp; Accounts Year ended 31 March 2026 </div><div class="faq_animated-box"><div class="faq-horizontal"></div><div class="faq-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="expandable-bottom"><div class="faq-paragraph w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12 w-richtext"><p><a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3cf43485ab7fac9a296/6a995da54cb744f81ed2b6f3_Tungsten%20West%20Plc%20-%202026%20Audit%20Signed%20Accounts.pdf">Annual Report &amp; Accounts Year ended 31 March 2026</a></p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--accordion--variant="investor-accordion" class="expandable-single"><div class="expandable-top"><div class="heading-style-h5 heading-alternative w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12">Half-yearly Results for the six months ended 30 Sept 2025</div><div class="faq_animated-box"><div class="faq-horizontal"></div><div class="faq-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="expandable-bottom"><div class="faq-paragraph w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12 w-richtext"><p>Tungsten West is pleased to present our <a href="https://www.londonstockexchange.com/news-article/TUN/results-for-the-six-months-ended-30-september-2025/17387916" target="_blank">Results for the six months ended 30 September 2025 - 07:00:03 24 Dec 2025 - TUN News article | London Stock Exchange</a></p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--accordion--variant="investor-accordion" class="expandable-single"><div class="expandable-top"><div class="heading-style-h5 heading-alternative w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12">Financial Results for year ended 31 March 2025</div><div class="faq_animated-box"><div class="faq-horizontal"></div><div class="faq-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="expandable-bottom"><div class="faq-paragraph w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12 w-richtext"><p><a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3cf43485ab7fac9a296/69e761e31f4c3f45660f99f0_Financial%20Results%20for%20year%20ended%2031%20March%202025.pdf" target="_blank">Full Year Results - 2025</a></p></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div data-wf--accordion--variant="investor-accordion" class="expandable-single"><div class="expandable-top"><div class="heading-style-h5 heading-alternative w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12">Half-yearly Results for the six months ended 30 Sept 2024</div><div class="faq_animated-box"><div class="faq-horizontal"></div><div class="faq-vertical"></div></div></div><div class="expandable-bottom"><div class="faq-paragraph w-variant-a5dfdbe1-c3a4-37ba-1c29-8e73e484cb12 w-richtext"><p>Tungsten West is pleased to present our <a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3cf43485ab7fac9a296/69e76154afa870dababffd62_Half-yearly%20Results%20for%20the%20six%20months%20ended%2030%20Sept%202024.pdf" target="_blank">half-year accounts to 30 September 2024</a>