</style></div></a></div></div></div><p data-w-id="fb444e16-c98e-c6f7-8bbf-e31f0e193e72" class="text-color-black"><strong>Get in touch</strong><br/><a href="tel:+441752278500">+44 1752 278500</a></p><a data-w-id="744a5a44-5e63-758d-89ec-b8675d04d0a4" href="/rns-email-alerts" class="text-style-link text-weight-800">Sign Up To RNS Alerts</a></div><div class="right-footer"><div id="w-node-c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-00016618457f-66184574" data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-00016618457f" class="coumn_footer"><div class="column-expand_top-tile"><div class="label-large">Company</div><div class="footer-expand_icon"><div class="line_footer-expand vertical"></div><div class="line_footer-expand horizontal"></div></div></div><div class="wrap_column-footer"><div class="column_footer-links"><a href="/about" class="link_footer">About Us</a><a href="/project/hemerdon-mine" class="link_footer">The Project</a><a href="/investors" aria-current="page" class="link_footer w--current">Investors</a><a href="/careers" class="link_footer">Careers</a></div></div></div><div id="w-node-c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-000166184596-66184574" data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-000166184596" class="coumn_footer no-borders"><div class="column-expand_top-tile"><div class="label-large">Sustainability</div><div class="footer-expand_icon"><div class="line_footer-expand vertical"></div><div class="line_footer-expand horizontal"></div></div></div><div class="wrap_column-footer"><div class="column_footer-links"><a href="/sustainability#neighbours" class="link_footer">Our Neighbours</a><a href="/sustainability#team" class="link_footer">Our Team</a><a href="/sustainability#environment" class="link_footer">Our Environment</a><a href="/action-plan-environment" class="link_footer">Environment Action</a></div></div></div><div data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-0001661845b1" class="coumn_footer"><div class="column-expand_top-tile"><div class="label-large">Tungsten West PLC</div><div class="footer-expand_icon"><div class="line_footer-expand vertical"></div><div class="line_footer-expand horizontal"></div></div></div><div class="wrap_column-footer"><div class="column_footer-links"><div class="iframe w-embed w-iframe"><iframe src="https://irtools.co.uk/tools/share_price/08688281-7ef0-46a5-89ab-1dec6bb31929"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="footer_bottom"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-0001661845df" class="footer_bottom-halves"><div data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-0001661845e0" class="footer_bottom-left"><p class="text-size-small tone-medium">Tungsten West Plc is a mining development company focused on restarting the world-class Hemerdon tungsten mine on the outskirts of Plymouth.<br/>The company is the 100% owner of the Hemerdon Mine, which is one of the largest tungsten resources in the world.</p></div><div data-w-id="c4544122-2b26-130c-b84b-0001661845e3" class="footer_bottom-right"><div class="text-size-small tone-subtle">© Tungsten West <span fs-hacks-element="year">20xx</span></div><div class="footer_legal"><a href="/policies" class="link_footer-legal">Policies</a><a href="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69e25f2f885db8a557dc4cff_TungstenWest_Privacy_Notice.pdf" target="_blank" class="link_footer-legal">Privacy Policy</a></div><div class="text-size-small">Designed by <a href="https://www.gforce.studio/" target="_blank" class="link_footer-legal">G-Force</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><script src="https://d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js?site=69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/js/webflow.schunk.36b8fb49256177c8.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-4abIlA5/v7XaW1HMXKBgnUuhnjBYJ/Z9C1OSg4OhmVw9O3QeHJ/qJqFBERCDPv7G" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/js/webflow.schunk.4df87652dcd3e412.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-FLot0lTywKPYSdSbDU6wdSJ+aLuMrfTYO4qqIFUyPBnvI99N8Jb0uAqGRg0gw6yP" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/js/webflow.schunk.cce306f7fd629ddb.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-IwqIephGnG67y7YvKqqQ+t++WBcjACr36OdYge9vn24ZcEbgr0dJvakQJxuYw6cW" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/js/webflow.2c720baf.bce51ffc6dccf84b.js" type="text/javascript" integrity="sha384-asyYzKVRZ8MVux60hun9QsiOWRjdX/afabbwbbzN0BNMVc5PU87OqTomsHGgtu7D" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.15.0/gsap.min.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.15.0/Flip.min.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.15.0/ScrollTrigger.min.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/gsap/3.15.0/SplitText.min.js" type="text/javascript"></script><script type="text/javascript">gsap.registerPlugin(Flip,ScrollTrigger,SplitText);</script><script>

document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  // Register ScrollTrigger plugin
  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);
  
  // Find all elements with the data-count-to attribute
  const countElements = document.querySelectorAll('[data-count-to]');
  
  countElements.forEach(element => {
    // Get custom attributes from the element
    const targetNumber = parseFloat(element.getAttribute('data-count-to')) || 100;
    const duration = parseFloat(element.getAttribute('data-duration')) || 2;
    const delay = parseFloat(element.getAttribute('data-delay')) || 0;
    const decimals = parseInt(element.getAttribute('data-decimals')) || 0;
    
    // Set initial value
    element.textContent = '0';
    
    // Create counter object
    const counter = { value: 0 };
    
    // Animate the counter with ScrollTrigger
    gsap.to(counter, {
      value: targetNumber,
      duration: duration,
      delay: delay,
      ease: 'power1.out',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: element,
        start: 'top 80%',
        toggleActions: 'play none none none',
        once: true
      },
      onUpdate: function() {
        element.textContent = counter.value.toFixed(decimals);
      }
    });
  });
});
</script>


<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
  const elements = document.querySelectorAll('[fs-hacks-element="year"]');
  const year = new Date().getFullYear();

  elements.forEach(el => {
    el.textContent = year;
  });
});
</script>

<script>
window.addEventListener('message', function(event) {

  var frames = document.getElementsByTagName('iframe');

  for (var i = 0; i < frames.length; i++) {

    if (frames[i].contentWindow === event.source) {

      var style = frames[i].currentStyle || window.getComputedStyle(frames[i]);

      var paddingTop = parseInt(style.paddingTop || 0);
      var paddingBottom = parseInt(style.paddingBottom || 0);

      var padding = paddingTop + paddingBottom;

      frames[i].style.height = event.data + padding + 'px';

      break;
    }
  }

});
</script><script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {

  // HANDLE initial load (deep link)
  function activateTabFromHash(hash) {
    if (!hash) return;

    const cleanHash = hash.toLowerCase().replace("#", "");

    const tabLink = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll(".w-tab-link"))
      .find(el => el.id.toLowerCase() === cleanHash);

    if (tabLink) {
      tabLink.click();
    }
  }

  // Run on page load
  setTimeout(() => {
    activateTabFromHash(window.location.hash);
  }, 100);


  // HANDLE clicks (same page navigation)
  document.querySelectorAll('a[href*="#"]').forEach(link => {
    link.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      const url = new URL(this.href);
      const targetHash = url.hash;

      // Only intercept if it's the SAME page
      if (window.location.pathname === url.pathname && targetHash) {
        e.preventDefault();

        // Activate tab
        activateTabFromHash(targetHash);

        // Update URL
        history.replaceState(null, null, targetHash);
      }
    });
  });

});
</script>


<script>
const iframe = document.querySelector('.pdf-frame');

document.querySelectorAll('[data-pdf-open]').forEach(btn => {
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const pdfUrl = btn.getAttribute('data-pdf');
    if (iframe && pdfUrl) {
      iframe.src = pdfUrl;
    }
  });
});
</script></body></html>